# Line endings are normalised to LF in the index and in the working tree.
#
# Two tests read files byte for byte: bench/test/fortunes.test.ts hashes the
# pinned TechEmpower download and compares the generated fixture against it.
# Without this file, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks those out
# with CRLF and the comparison fails for a reason that has nothing to do with
# the data.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Pinned upstream data, hashed by SHA-256. Never let a filter touch it.
bench/fixtures/canonical-fortunes.sql -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.sqlite binary
